msgstr "Maaf, masa ini baru sahaja penuh. Sila pilih masa lain."

msgid "That time is no longer available."
msgstr "Masa itu tidak lagi tersedia."

msgid "That would create too many slots at once."
msgstr "Itu akan mencipta terlalu banyak slot sekali gus."

msgid "The check-in time for this booking has passed. Please ask at the counter."
msgstr "Masa daftar masuk untuk tempahan ini telah tamat. Sila bertanya di kaunter."

msgid "The end time must be after the start time."
msgstr "Masa tamat mestilah selepas masa mula."

msgid "The time range is shorter than one slot."
msgstr "Julat masa lebih pendek daripada satu slot."

msgid "This booking can no longer be cancelled."
