msgstr "Keluar baris"

msgid "Left queue: customers who cancelled their ticket. Bookings cancelled: appointments cancelled in advance."
msgstr "Keluar baris: pelanggan yang membatalkan tiket. Tempahan dibatalkan: temu janji yang dibatalkan lebih awal."

msgid "Median wait (min)"
msgstr "Median menunggu (min)"

